1
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:10,220
Hello, little friend! I am Mooshak!

2
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,880
Squeak-squeak!

3
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:18,620
That is my best friend, Ganpati Bappa!

4
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,739
Say it with me!

5
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:25,351
Ganpati Bappa… Morya!

6
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,478
High on Mount Kailash, Ganesha lived.

7
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:33,134
His home was warm and cosy.

8
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:38,674
Amma Parvati was kind and loving.

9
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,487
Baba Shiva was calm and gentle.

10
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:46,054
Ganesha had a brother, Kartikeya.

11
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,324
Kartikeya rode a shiny blue peacock.

12
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:55,446
Ganesha loved modaks, sweet and round.

13
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,843
And Mooshak loved them too!

14
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:01,370
Can you count the modaks?

15
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:06,905
One… two… three!

16
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:08,560
Squeak-squeak!

17
00:01:09,450 --> 00:01:12,478
One morning, Baba held a golden mango.

18
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:14,363
It was very special.

19
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:20,217
Baba said, "Let's have a race!"

20
00:01:20,270 --> 00:01:22,950
Go around the world three times.

21
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:29,130
First one back wins the mango!

22
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:31,697
Kartikeya hopped onto his peacock.

23
00:01:34,450 --> 00:01:37,304
Over rivers and forests he flew.

24
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,954
Flap, flap, flap went the peacock!

25
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:44,283
Can you flap your arms?

26
00:01:46,330 --> 00:01:48,250
Flap, flap, flap!

27
00:01:51,450 --> 00:01:53,967
Ganesha looked at his little feet.

28
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:56,363
He had no peacock to fly.

29
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:01,620
Mooshak gave him a little pat.

30
00:02:01,670 --> 00:02:03,280
Squeak-squeak!

31
00:02:07,450 --> 00:02:10,054
Ganesha thought and thought…

32
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:12,440
I have an idea, Mooshak!

33
00:02:15,450 --> 00:02:17,543
He looked at Amma and Baba.

34
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:20,270
His heart felt warm and happy.

35
00:02:23,450 --> 00:02:26,304
Off he went, slow and steady.

36
00:02:26,350 --> 00:02:29,748
Ganpati Bappa… Morya!

37
00:02:31,450 --> 00:02:33,793
Can you count his circles with me?

38
00:02:39,450 --> 00:02:43,098
One… two… three!

39
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:45,320
Three whole circles!

40
00:02:47,450 --> 00:02:50,130
Kartikeya zoomed home on his peacock.

41
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:52,273
He looked so surprised!

42
00:02:55,450 --> 00:02:57,967
"How did you win?" asked Kartikeya.

43
00:02:58,020 --> 00:03:00,624
Ganesha smiled and held their hands.

44
00:03:03,450 --> 00:03:05,710
I walked around Amma and Baba.

45
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,780
They are my whole world!

46
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:15,478
Amma and Baba smiled so proudly.

47
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:18,384
Baba gave Ganesha the golden mango.

48
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:23,620
Hooray for Ganesha!

49
00:03:23,670 --> 00:03:27,068
Ganpati Bappa… Morya!

50
00:03:28,450 --> 00:03:30,707
Ganesha did not eat it alone.

51
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,593
He shared it with his brother.

52
00:03:37,450 --> 00:03:39,880
Kartikeya laughed and hugged him.

53
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:42,360
Mooshak got a tiny bite too!

54
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:48,217
That evening, the family sat together.

55
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:50,787
Everyone felt warm and happy.

56
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:56,707
Now you know Ganesha's secret.

57
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:59,440
Our family is our whole world.

58
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,960
♪ Hold your family, hold them near, ♪

59
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,980
♪ They are your whole world, dear! ♪

60
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:14,980
♪ Ganpati Bappa… Morya! ♪

61
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:18,120
♪ Ganpati Bappa… Morya! ♪

62
00:04:20,450 --> 00:04:22,710
Bye-bye, little friend!

63
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,210
Squeak-squeak!
